+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fixed a bug where :meth:`.PauliOp.adjoint` did not return a correct value for Paulis
+    with complex coefficients, like ``PauliOp(Pauli("iX"))``. 
+    Fixed `#9433 <https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-terra/issues/9433>`.
